Third-party notices
===================

Video Quality Test Tool is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. Refer to LICENSE-MIT and
LICENSE-APACHE.

This file covers the code that is built into the binary. It does not cover FFmpeg, vmaf,
FFVship or ssimulacra2_rs. The tool starts each of those as a separate process, links none of
them, and ships none of them. You supply them yourself.

The window ships the IBM Plex faces that are in crates/vqtt-gui/assets/fonts. They are under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and their notice is:

    Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex"

The full text of that license is below, under OFL-1.1.

This file is generated. To write it again, run:

    cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD-PARTY

